label story_07_fail (The Final Bloom Failed)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): The Devourer has not been stopped. I can still feel it — beneath every root, patient and vast, breathing where breath should not reach.
"Dianthus Core": The full bloom I dreamed of will not open tonight. Perhaps not ever. That is a wound I must learn to carry.
"Dianthus Core": But a lingering bloom is not nothing. If we cannot win the dawn outright, we can make the dark pay for every breath it steals from us.
"Dianthus Core": Stay with me, little alchemist. We endure as long as one petal remembers what light felt like.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_alt_devourer_loss"]
[end_timeline]
